      "created_at": "2020-10-12T16:33:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just for sanity's sake, some of the achievements (such as Season Passed: Defeat all season 1+2 villains) I have done way too many times. Only defeats AFTER the update launches count towards it.</p>\n<p>Can we assume the update will be on the 14th? And can we get a planned release time? (I know, I know, Man plans, Gods do&nbsp;their own thing). I need to start planning some games to try to get in that Hall of Fame :D<br>\n<br>\n~A-Kat</p>",
